flowchart TD
  Dev[Developer] --> Git[GitHub repository]
  Git --> CI[Jenkins pipeline]
  CI --> Test[Pytest + SonarQube + Trivy]
  Test --> Image[Docker image]
  Image --> Registry[Container registry]
  Registry --> CD[ArgoCD GitOps]
  CD --> K8s[Kubernetes cluster]
  K8s --> App[TaskFlow Flask application]
  App --> DB[(PostgreSQL PVC)]
  K8s --> Prom[Prometheus]
  Prom --> Graf[Grafana]
  K8s --> Logs[Container log collector]
